OL,4,T#######################################
OL,5,F"SFO HAS BOWED TO POLITICAL PRESSURE"
OL,6, Nick Leeson's lawyer has accused the
OL,7, Serious Fraud Office of "bowing to
OL,8, political pressure" by not seeking his
OL,9, client's extradition.
OL,10,F
OL,11,FStephen Pollard said the SFO had all
OL,12,Fthe "evidence it needed" to seek his
OL,13,Fclient's extradition, yet it was
OL,14,Fsending him to Singapore to face lesser
OL,15,Fcharges.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FMr Pollard said he would "battle to
OL,18,Foverturn this irrational decision".
OL,19,F
OL,20,FThe claim was "strongly denied" by an
OL,21,FSFO spokeswoman.
OL,23,T]FFromG13-09-95F  teletextarchive.com
