OL,5,FSERBS LOSE GROUND TO MUSLIMS & CROATS
OL,6, Bosnian Croat and Muslim forces, backed
OL,7, by the Croatian army, have made major
OL,8, gains against the Serbs in central and
OL,9, western Bosnia, according to the UN.
OL,11,FUN special envoy Yasushi Akashi said he
OL,12,Fbelieved the forces had taken the town
OL,13,Fof Donji Vakuf and had opened up a
OL,14,Froute between Tuzla and Zenica.G
OL,15,F
OL,16,FThe situation looked very serious for
OL,17,Fthe Bosnian Serbs, the UN said.G
OL,18,F
OL,19,FBritain condemned the offensives. But
OL,20,Fthe Foreign Office denied the Croats
OL,21,Fwere being helped by NATO air raids
OL,22,Fwhich have continued around Sarajevo.
OL,23,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,GFrom 13-09-95
