OL,4,T#######################################
OL,5,FBOSNIAN SERB REFUGEES FLEE NEW ADVANCE
OL,6, Thousands of Bosnian Serb refugees are
OL,7, reported to be fleeing as Croat and
OL,8, Bosnian government forces advance into
OL,9, Serb-held territory.
OL,11,FRelief workers say up to 50,000 Serb
OL,12,Fcivilians are leaving towns in central
OL,13,Fand western Bosnia.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FMost are on the main road linking the
OL,16,FBihac area to the town of Zenica.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FSome 60,000 Serb soldiers are reported
OL,19,Fto be surrounded near Donji Vakuf and
OL,20,Fthe town is said to be under serious
OL,21,Fthreat.
OL,23,T]FFromG13-09-95F  teletextarchive.com
